  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個由 Serilum 製作的模組。充滿愛心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>Shadow Mounts 是一個為 SpookyJam 2024 製作的模組，新增了「暗影鞍具」物品。這款獨特的鞍具可以裝備在任何馬匹上，將其轉變為暗影形態。紋理會變暗，斑紋將呈現靈魂火焰的藍色。騎乘時會顯示粒子效果！<br><br>目前效果僅限視覺呈現，但我計畫在未來新增更多功能。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg&w=586\" alt=\"環境：客戶端與伺服器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳情</summary>\n<p><span><strong>darkenHorseTexture</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>裝備暗影鞍具時，是否要將馬匹紋理變暗。<br><br><span><strong>showShadowHorseParticles</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>是否要顯示暗影坐騎的粒子效果。<br><br><span><strong>onlyShowParticlesWhenRiding</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用後，僅在玩家騎乘時才會顯示暗影坐騎的粒子效果。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>製作暗影鞍具的配方：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/shadow-mounts/a.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>暗影坐騎會產生特殊的粒子效果：<br>靜止時有少量，移動時則有大量粒子！**</span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/shadow-mounts/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><br><span><strong>新的鞍具能將任何馬匹轉化為暗影變體：</strong></span></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/shadow-mounts/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"注意事項與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以自由在任何整合包中使用此模組，只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內即可。**</span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 儲存庫</a>。感謝您！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
